<title>GERMANY: Bayer - no comment on Roche report, plans statement.</title>
<headline>Bayer - no comment on Roche report, plans statement.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group Bayer AG on Monday declined to comment on a report in the New York Times that it planned to start a joint venture with Roche Holding Ltd in the U.S.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Bayer said in response to a Reuter enquiry that the company would issue a statement later today.</p>
<p>The New York Times said Bayer and Roche were starting a joint venture to sell Roche's Aleve analgesic and other products.</p>
</text>
